{"page":1,"results":[{"adult":false,"gender":0,"id":1523623,"known_for_department":"Directing","name":"Neven Hitrec","original_name":"Neven Hitrec","popularity":0.2315,"profile_path":null,"known_for":[{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"id":397481,"title":"The Man Under the Table","original_title":"Čovjek ispod stola","overview":"The microcosmic world of a street market on the outskirts of Zagreb: traders, thieves, prostitutes, self-appointed security guards and other lost souls, each with their own unique ideas, passion or mania. We follow the tragicomic, mutually intertwined mini dramas of each character, as they fight to save the marketplace itself, when city planners threaten to raze it to the ground and replace it with a skyscraper.","poster_path":"/rvyTgheSNusvgXwK2gzrSw73j9T.jpg","media_type":"movie","original_language":"hr","genre_ids":[18],"popularity":0.4531,"release_date":"2009-07-22","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":5.0,"vote_count":3},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/jY8JTPTydM1eJ880k6o75mfBAQu.jpg","id":1104601,"title":"The Diary of Paulina P.","original_title":"Dnevnik Pauline P.","overview":"This is a story about Paulina P. in which we follow her adventures in class and at home, as well as all the problems she successfully overcomes during the school year. The movie is based on a famous children's book in which she talks about her friendship, love, and family-related problems through comic situations. The plot of the movie itself is set in the real world, with a touch of \"magic\".","poster_path":"/3YjCBoucA8vQ6MI9GpdGCdfGaXP.jpg","media_type":"movie","original_language":"hr","genre_ids":[35,10751],"popularity":0.8657,"release_date":"2023-03-17","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":8.0,"vote_count":1},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"id":364269,"title":"Madonna","original_title":"Bogorodica","overview":"In a small Croatian village in 1991, a carpenter Kuzma falls for much younger Ana. In spite of their surroundings' opposition towards their relationship, the couple marries and Ana gives birth to their son. Being also familiar with the statuary, he makes a sculpture of Madonna for the local church. A quiet life of the village is disturbed when the first clashes between Croats and Serbs arise.","poster_path":"/8XLa1xO5jVZDIOpsEWaSOcKKzAb.jpg","media_type":"movie","original_language":"hr","genre_ids":[18],"popularity":0.4711,"release_date":"1999-01-01","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":6.5,"vote_count":2}]}],"total_pages":1,"total_results":1}